Build Docker Image (runtime / arm64)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-30T19:53:42.7956455Z               "message": "feat: emergency any-token core and token auth failure diagnostics (#645, #644)\n\nSplit token verification failures into distinct TokenError variants\n(signature, issuer secret unset, missing record, binding mismatch), count\nthem by stable reason code without storing token values, and add an\nEmergencyAuth state that - only when explicitly enabled - maps any\nnon-empty client token to synthetic, non-admin, budget-free claims so no\ndurable record is written or revived.",
