Build Docker Image (runtime / arm64)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-30T19:53:42.7966410Z               "message": "feat: emergency-auth flags, startup guard, management endpoints and diagnostics wiring (#645, #644)\n\n- --emergency-accept-any-token / EMERGENCY_ACCEPT_ANY_TOKEN (off by default),\n  --emergency-allow-non-loopback and --emergency-duration-minutes; startup\n  refuses a non-loopback listener without the acknowledgement\n- GET /api/management/emergency-auth, POST .../emergency-auth/disable and\n  GET /api/management/auth/diagnostics (admin only; no enable endpoint)\n- health header, metrics, admin summary and doctor show the mode\n- host-native deploy spawns strip the emergency env vars\n- count one authentication outcome per request (the aggregate catalog\n  re-authenticates per provider and tripled the counters)\n- the Gemini carrier outranks the at- prefix when inferring the client\n- run-lease heartbeat treats a legacy 404/405 as unsupported, not an\n  auth failure, and stops; failures are recorded under distinct reasons\n- integration tests across carriers, token kinds, disable, restart,\n  concurrency, store immutability and diagnostics",
